msgid ""
"  codecs web   Web video in Firefox only. Replaces Fedora's empty OpenH264 stand-in with\n"
"               Cisco's OpenH264 from Fedora's Cisco repository, under Cisco's own H.264\n"
"               patent license.\n"
"  codecs full  Everything. Replaces Fedora's free ffmpeg libraries with the full ffmpeg,\n"
"               x264 and x265 from RPM Fusion, the source standard Fedora uses."
msgstr ""
"  codecs web   Web bideoa Firefoxen soilik. Fedoraren OpenH264 ordezko hutsa ordezkatzen du\n"
"               Ciscoren OpenH264-rekin, Fedoraren Cisco biltegitik, Ciscoren beraren H.264\n"
"               patente-lizentziapean.\n"
"  codecs full  Dena. Fedoraren ffmpeg liburutegi libreak ordezkatzen ditu ffmpeg osoarekin,\n"
"               x264rekin eta x265ekin, RPM Fusion-etik: Fedora estandarrak erabiltzen duen iturria."

msgid ""
"  evenkeel-os-packages install [FILE]   install an .rpm or .deb (no FILE: pick one from Downloads)\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages remove           remove an app installed this way\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages check FILE       say what a package needs, without installing anything\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages repair           set a broken app box up again (--if-broken: only if one does not work)\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages login            choose box apps that start when you log in\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages windows FILE     a Windows .exe or .msi: offer a Linux app that does its job\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages check-windows FILE  say what a Windows file is and what would be offered, without any window\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages zoom LINK        a Zoom \"open the app\" link: open the meeting in Zoom's web version, in Chrome\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages vpn [NAME]       add a VPN from its company's own download source (mullvad, proton, ivpn,\n"
"                                        nordvpn; no NAME: pick one)"
msgstr ""
"  evenkeel-os-packages install [FILE]   instalatu .rpm edo .deb bat (FILE gabe: aukeratu bat Deskargak karpetatik)\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages remove           kendu modu honetan instalatutako aplikazio bat\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages check FILE       esan pakete batek zer behar duen, ezer instalatu gabe\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages repair           konfiguratu berriro aplikazio-kutxa hondatu bat (--if-broken: batek funtzionatzen ez badu soilik)\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages login            aukeratu saioa hastean abiaraziko diren kutxako aplikazioak\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages windows FILE     Windows .exe edo .msi bat: haren lana egiten duen Linux aplikazio bat eskaini\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages check-windows FILE  esan zer den Windows fitxategi bat eta zer eskainiko litzatekeen, leihorik gabe\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages zoom LINK        Zoom-en \"ireki aplikazioa\" esteka bat: ireki bilera Zoom-en web bertsioan, Chrome-n\n"
"  evenkeel-os-packages vpn [NAME]       gehitu VPN bat bere enpresaren deskarga-iturritik (mullvad, proton, ivpn,\n"
"                                        nordvpn; NAME gabe: aukeratu bat)"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" comes with Fedora. The trusted list is rebuilt from Fedora's "
"current list at every start, so an update replaces or drops it; keep "
"automatic updates on. If this alert stays after updating and restarting, tell"
" your helper."
msgstr ""
"\"{name}\" Fedorarekin dator. Konfiantzazko zerrenda Fedoraren uneko "
"zerrendatik berreraikitzen da abio bakoitzean, beraz, eguneratze batek "
"ordezkatu edo kendu egiten du; utzi eguneratze automatikoak aktibatuta. Abisu"
" hau eguneratu eta berrabiarazi ondoren ere agertzen bada, esan zure "
"laguntzaileari."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" has expired, but its file ({file}) holds {n} certificate, and "
"removing it would remove them all, the good ones too. Tell your helper."
msgid_plural ""
"\"{name}\" has expired, but its file ({file}) holds {n} certificates, and "
"removing it would remove them all, the good ones too. Tell your helper."
msgstr[0] ""
"\"{name}\" iraungita dago, baina bere fitxategiak ({file}) {n} ziurtagiri du,"
" eta fitxategia kenduz gero, denak kenduko lirateke, onak ere bai. Esan zure "
"laguntzaileari."
msgstr[1] ""
"\"{name}\" iraungita dago, baina bere fitxategiak ({file}) {n} ziurtagiri "
"ditu, eta fitxategia kenduz gero, denak kenduko lirateke, onak ere bai. Esan "
"zure laguntzaileari."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" has expired. It was added in a way Wheelhouse can't remove; tell "
"your helper."
msgstr ""
"\"{name}\" iraungita dago. Wheelhouse-k kendu ezin duen moduan gehitu zen; "
"esan zure laguntzaileari."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "\"{name}\" is removed and no longer trusted."
msgstr "\"{name}\" kendu egin da eta jada ez da fidagarritzat hartzen."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" was added to this computer and expired on {date}. An expired "
"certificate shouldn't be relied on. Remove it if you no longer need it; if "
"you do, ask whoever gave it to you for a new one. Removing it needs your "
"password."
msgstr ""
"\"{name}\" ordenagailu honetan gehitu zen eta {date}(e)an iraungi zen. Ez "
"zenuke iraungitako ziurtagiri batean fidatu behar. Kendu ezazu jada behar ez "
"baduzu; behar baduzu, eskatu berri bat eman zizunari. Kentzeko zure pasahitza"
" behar da."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"\"{name}\" was added to this computer and expires on {date}. Ask whoever gave"
" it to you for a new one before then."
msgstr ""
"\"{name}\" ordenagailu honetan gehitu zen eta {date}(e)an iraungiko da. Data "
"hori iritsi aurretik, eskatu berri bat eman zizunari."

#. Translators: a weekday and date ("Thursday, November 26"). Uses strftime codes.
msgid "%A, %B %-d"
msgstr "%B %-d(a), %A"

#. Translators: a date: month and day ("November 26"). Uses strftime codes.
msgid "%B %-d"
msgstr "%Bren %-d(a)"

#. Translators: a date and a 12-hour time ("November 26, 7:02 PM"). Uses strftime codes.
msgid "%B %-d, %-I:%M %p"
msgstr "%Bren %-d(a) (%-I:%M %p)"

#. Translators: a date and a 24-hour time ("November 26, 19:02"). Uses strftime codes.
msgid "%B %-d, %H:%M"
msgstr "%Bren %-d(a) (%H:%M)"

msgid "(nothing was printed)"
msgstr "(komandoak ez du ezer erakutsi)"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "- and {n} more"
msgid_plural "- and {n} more"
msgstr[0] "- eta beste {n}"
msgstr[1] "- eta beste {n}"

msgid ""
"1.00 is the normal size. Large text in Settings, Accessibility sets 1.25."
msgstr ""
"1,00 da tamaina normala. Ezarpenak, Erabilerraztasuna ataleko Testu handia "
"aukerak 1,25 ezartzen du."

msgid "12 hour"
msgstr "12 orduko"

msgid "24 hour"
msgstr "24 orduko"

msgid ""
"A .deb driver can't be installed. The window says how to get the .rpm from "
"the maker."
msgstr ""
"Ezin da .deb formatuko kontrolatzailea instalatu. Leihoak azaltzen du nola "
"lortu .rpm fitxategia fabrikatzailearengandik."

msgid "A USB mouse works."
msgstr "USB saguak funtzionatzen du."

msgid "A USB webcam works."
msgstr "USB webkamera bat funtzionatzen du."

msgid "A VPN"
msgstr "VPN bat"

msgid "A Windows program you downloaded (.exe or .msi)"
msgstr "Deskargatu duzun Windows programa bat (.exe edo .msi)"

msgid "A background service fails"
msgstr "Atzeko planoko zerbitzu batek huts egiten du"

msgid ""
"A background service that runs on this computer fails to start (the mobile "
"broadband service, or the graphics switching service)."
msgstr ""
"Ordenagailu honetan exekutatzen den atzeko planoko zerbitzu bat ez da "
"abiarazten (banda zabal mugikorreko zerbitzua edo grafikoak aldatzeko "
"zerbitzua)."

msgid "A bottom bar, with a start menu on the logo"
msgstr "Beheko barra bat, hasiera-menua logotipoan duela"

msgid "A broken app box"
msgstr "Aplikazio-kutxa hondatu bat"

msgid "A built-in camera of the newer laptop kind was found."
msgstr ""
"Azken belaunaldiko ordenagailu eramangarrietan ohikoa den kamera integratua "
"aurkitu da."

msgid "A café, hotel, airport, or anywhere else. Nothing gets in."
msgstr ""
"Kafetegi bat, hotel bat, aireportu bat edo beste edozein leku. Ezer ez da "
"sartzen."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "A certificate needs attention"
msgid_plural "{n} certificates need attention"
msgstr[0] "{n} ziurtagirik arreta behar du"
msgstr[1] "{n} ziurtagirik arreta behar dute"

msgid ""
"A change to the boot options is waiting. It starts at your next restart. It isn't an update.\n"
"\n"
"If you don't want it: Don't use it. The computer starts with the boot options it has now, and automatic updates aren't paused.\n"
"\n"
"Or Keep it."
msgstr ""
"Abio-aukeretako aldaketa bat zain dago. Hurrengo berrabiaraztean hasiko da. Ez da eguneratze bat.\n"
"\n"
"Ez baduzu nahi: Ez erabili. Ordenagailua orain dituen abio-aukerekin abiatuko da, eta eguneratze automatikoak ez dira pausatuko.\n"
"\n"
"Edo Mantendu."

msgid "A device"
msgstr "Gailu bat"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "A device lost its driver ({driver})"
msgstr "Gailu batek bere kontrolatzailea galdu du ({driver})"

msgid "A disk is hidden."
msgstr "Disko bat ezkutatuta dago."

msgid "A driver file from the maker"
msgstr "Fabrikatzailearen kontrolatzaile-fitxategia"

msgid "A file of recent errors to email to your helper"
msgstr ""
"Azken erroreak biltzen dituen fitxategia, zure laguntzaileari posta "
"elektronikoz bidaltzeko"

msgid "A full name can't have : or , in it."
msgstr "Izen osoak ezin ditu : edo , izan."

msgid "A graphics chip has no driver."
msgstr "Grafiko-txipak ez du kontrolatzailearik."

msgid ""
"A network is only needed for automatic time and time zone. To use Wi-Fi, "
"click a network. Or click Next to go on without it."
msgstr ""
"Sarea ordua eta ordu-zona automatikoki ezartzeko soilik behar da. Wifia "
"erabiltzeko, egin klik sare batean. Edo egin klik Hurrengoa botoian hura gabe"
" jarraitzeko."

msgid ""
"A new layout shows after you log out and back in. It changes only your own "
"desktop."
msgstr ""
"Diseinu berria agertuko da saioa amaitu eta berriro hasi ondoren. Zure "
"mahaigaina bakarrik aldatzen du."

msgid "A new system is ready."
msgstr "Sistema berria prest dago."

msgid "A new system is ready. Restart to use it."
msgstr "Sistema berria prest dago. Berrabiarazi erabili ahal izateko."

msgid ""
"A new system version is used from the next restart. Keep working, and restart"
" when it suits you."
msgstr ""
"Hurrengo berrabiaraztetik aurrera sistemaren bertsio berria erabiliko da. "
"Jarraitu lanean, eta berrabiarazi komeni zaizunean."

msgid ""
"A new version also goes back if something that worked before is broken after "
"you log in, like sound, Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, the camera or printing. Unplugged "
"or switched-off things don't count."
msgstr ""
"Bertsio berria atzera ere itzultzen da saioa hasi ondoren lehen funtzionatzen"
" zuen zerbait hondatuta badago, adibidez soinua, wifia, Bluetootha, kamera "
"edo inprimatzea. Deskonektatuta edo itzalita dauden gauzak ez dira kontuan "
"hartzen."

msgid "A new version is ready"
msgstr "Bertsio berri bat prest dago"

msgid ""
"A note at the next login says so and names what broke, and automatic updates "
"pause for 3 days."
msgstr ""
"Hurrengo saio-hasieran ohar batek hori esango du eta zer hondatu den "
"adieraziko du, eta eguneratze automatikoak 3 egunez pausatuko dira."

msgid ""
"A rollback test copy is running. Restart first, so the computer goes back to "
"the usual version."
msgstr ""
"Atzera-egitearen proba-kopia bat exekutatzen ari da. Berrabiarazi lehenik, "
"ordenagailua ohiko bertsiora itzul dadin."

msgid "A security certificate expired, expires within 30 days, or was removed."
msgstr ""
"Segurtasun-ziurtagiri bat iraungi da, 30 egun barru iraungiko da, edo kendu "
"egin da."

msgid "A slideshow of your own pictures"
msgstr "Zure argazkien diapositiba-aurkezpena"

msgid "A sound chip was found, but it didn't start."
msgstr "Soinu-txip bat aurkitu da, baina ez da abiatu."

msgid "A start-up check fails"
msgstr "Abioko egiaztapen batek huts egiten du"

msgid ""
"A start-up check fails on purpose. The computer restarts by itself within "
"seconds, twice, and the third start is back on this version."
msgstr ""
"Abioko egiaztapen batek nahita huts egiten du. Ordenagailua bere kabuz "
"berrabiaraziko da segundo gutxiren buruan, bi aldiz, eta hirugarren abioan "
"bertsio honetara itzuliko da."

msgid "A system service fails"
msgstr "Sistema-zerbitzu batek huts egiten du"

msgid "A system update is also waiting for a restart."
msgstr "Sistema-eguneratze bat ere berrabiaraztearen zain dago."

msgid "A tool"
msgstr "Tresna bat"

msgid "A top bar, with the logo menu at the top left"
msgstr "Goiko barra bat, logotipoaren menua goian ezkerrean duela"

msgid ""
"A user name uses small letters, digits, - and _, and starts with a letter."
msgstr ""
"Erabiltzaile-izenak letra xeheak, zifrak, - eta _ erabiltzen ditu, eta letraz"
" hasten da."

msgid ""
"A wired network is set to Home, so this happens on any cable you plug in."
msgstr ""
"Kable bidezko sarea Etxea gisa ezarrita dago, beraz, hau konektatzen duzun "
"edozein kablerekin gertatzen da."

msgid "A wireless chip was found, but it didn't start."
msgstr "Haririk gabeko txip bat aurkitu da, baina ez da abiatu."

msgid "A wireless chip was found, with no driver for it."
msgstr ""
"Haririk gabeko txip bat aurkitu da, baina ez dago harentzako "
"kontrolatzailerik."

msgid "AMD: flicker, turn off Panel Replay"
msgstr "AMD: keinuak, desaktibatu Panel Replay"

msgid "AMD: flicker, turn off Panel Self Refresh"
msgstr "AMD: keinuak, desaktibatu Panel Self Refresh"

msgid "AMD: flicker, turn off both"
msgstr "AMD: keinuak, desaktibatu biak"

msgid "AMD: screen dims or shifts colors on its own"
msgstr "AMD: pantaila iluntzen da edo koloreak aldatzen dira bere kabuz"

msgid "AMD: white flickering"
msgstr "AMD: keinu zuriak pantailan"

msgid ""
"About 20 seconds after the login screen shows, the computer locks up. Hold "
"the power button until it turns off, then turn it on. After the second "
"freeze, the next start is back on this version."
msgstr ""
"Saio-hasierako pantaila agertu eta 20 segundo ingurura, ordenagailua blokeatu"
" egiten da. Eutsi pizteko botoia sakatuta itzali arte, eta gero piztu. "
"Bigarren izoztearen ondoren, hurrengo abioa bertsio honetara itzuliko da."

msgid "About it"
msgstr "Honi buruz"

msgid "About this driver"
msgstr "Kontrolatzaile honi buruz"

msgid "Accent color and wallpaper"
msgstr "Kolore orokorra eta horma-papera"

msgid "Account"
msgstr "Kontua"

msgid "Add"
msgstr "Gehitu"

msgid "Add a folder"
msgstr "Gehitu karpeta bat"

msgid "Add a folder and set the sharing password below."
msgstr "Gehitu karpeta bat eta ezarri partekatzeko pasahitza behean."

msgid "Add a folder from your home folder."
msgstr "Gehitu karpeta bat zure karpeta nagusitik."

msgid "Add a printer"
msgstr "Gehitu inprimagailu bat"

msgid "Add a setting, like amdgpu.abmlevel=0"
msgstr "Gehitu ezarpen bat, adibidez amdgpu.abmlevel=0"

msgid "Add anyway"
msgstr "Gehitu hala ere"

msgid "Add it"
msgstr "Gehitu"

msgid ""
"Add it only if you know you need it. If the computer then won't start, "
"automatic rollback goes back to the version before."
msgstr ""
"Gehitu ezazu behar duzula badakizu soilik. Ondoren ordenagailua abiatzen ez "
"bada, atzera-egite automatikoak aurreko bertsiora itzuliko du."

msgid "Add or remove an app's hardware rules"
msgstr "Gehitu edo kendu aplikazio baten hardware-arauak"

msgid "Add or remove media codecs"
msgstr "Gehitu edo kendu multimedia kodekak"

msgid "Add the media codecs"
msgstr "Gehitu multimedia kodekak"

msgid "Add to the system"
msgstr "Gehitu sistemara"

msgid "Add video and audio codecs"
msgstr "Gehitu bideo- eta audio-kodekak"

msgid "Add, turn on or remove a VPN or an app's background service"
msgstr ""
"Gehitu, aktibatu edo kendu VPN bat edo aplikazio baten atzeko planoan "
"exekutatzen den zerbitzua"

msgid "Added by you"
msgstr "Zuk gehitu duzu"

msgid "Added to this computer"
msgstr "Ordenagailu honetan gehitu da"

msgid "Adding a printer, and printer driver files from the maker"
msgstr ""
"Inprimagailu bat gehitzea, eta fabrikatzailearen inprimagailu-"
"kontrolatzaileen fitxategiak"

msgid ""
"Adding the desktop parts apps expect (progress windows and notifications)"
msgstr ""
"Aplikazioek espero dituzten mahaigaineko osagaiak gehitzea (aurrerapen-"
"leihoak eta jakinarazpenak)"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding the download source {name}"
msgstr "{name} deskarga-iturria gehitzen"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system"
msgstr "{title} sistemara gehitzen"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system from Fedora. A progress window shows it."
msgstr ""
"{title} sistemara gehitzen Fedoratik. Aurrerapen-leiho batek erakusten du."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system from Fedora. This can take a few minutes."
msgstr "{title} sistemara gehitzen Fedoratik. Minutu batzuk iraun ditzake."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system. A progress window shows it."
msgstr "{title} sistemara gehitzen. Aurrerapen-leiho batek erakusten du."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "Adding {title} to the system. This can take a few minutes."
msgstr "{title} sistemara gehitzen. Minutu batzuk iraun ditzake."

msgid "Administrator"
msgstr "Administratzailea"

msgid "Administrator account (root)"
msgstr "Administratzaile-kontua (root)"

msgid "Administrator: no."
msgstr "Administratzailea: ez."

msgid "Administrator: yes."
msgstr "Administratzailea: bai."

msgid ""
"After a BIOS update, it may ask for the disk password again. Turn it on again"
" here."
msgstr ""
"BIOSa eguneratu ondoren, baliteke diskoaren pasahitza berriro eskatzea. "
"Aktibatu berriro hemen."

msgid ""
"After an undo, so the same update doesn't come straight back. They turn back "
"on by themselves."
msgstr ""
"Desegite baten ondoren, eguneratze bera berehala itzul ez dadin. Berez "
"aktibatzen dira berriro."

msgid "After the restart, you will be asked to add your printer."
msgstr "Berrabiarazi ondoren, inprimagailua gehitzeko eskatuko zaizu."

msgid ""
"After the restart, you'll be asked for your password once, to turn it on."
msgstr ""
"Berrabiarazi ondoren, zure pasahitza behin eskatuko zaizu, aktibatzeko."

msgid "After the restart, you'll get a message when it's ready."
msgstr "Berrabiarazi ondoren, prest dagoenean mezu bat jasoko duzu."

msgid "Alpha"
msgstr "Alfa"

msgid "Also let in, on Home"
msgstr "Utzi sartzen Etxean ere"

msgid ""
"Alt+Tab switches between apps. Alt and the key above Tab switches between "
"windows of the same app."
msgstr ""
"Alt+Tab teklek aplikazio batetik bestera aldatzen dute. Alt teklak eta Tab-en"
" gaineko teklak aplikazio bereko leiho batetik bestera aldatzen dute."

msgid ""
"An .rpm or .deb installs the app. An .exe or .msi gets its Linux version."
msgstr ""
".rpm edo .deb batek aplikazioa instalatzen du. .exe edo .msi batekin, haren "
"Linux bertsioa lortzen duzu."

msgid "An app that comes as a .rpm or .deb file"
msgstr ".rpm edo .deb fitxategi gisa datorren aplikazioa"

msgid "An office. Nothing gets in, and your folders aren't shared."
msgstr "Bulego bat. Ezer ez da sartzen, eta zure karpetak ez dira partekatzen."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"An update from {staged} is waiting. It starts at your next restart. The version you're using now is from {booted}.\n"
"\n"
"If you don't want it: Don't use it. Your computer keeps the version it has now. A boot options change made since the update came is dropped with it."
msgstr ""
"{staged}(e)ko eguneratze bat zain dago. Hurrengo berrabiaraztean hasiko da. Orain erabiltzen ari zaren bertsioa {booted}(e)koa da.\n"
"\n"
"Ez baduzu nahi: Ez erabili. Zure ordenagailuak orain duen bertsioa mantenduko du. Eguneratzea iritsi zenetik egindako abio-aukeren aldaketa bat ere harekin batera baztertuko da."

msgid "An update is waiting for a restart. Restart first, then run the test."
msgstr ""
"Eguneratze bat berrabiaraztearen zain dago. Berrabiarazi lehenik, eta gero "
"egin proba."

msgid "Another disk is hidden by a BIOS setting."
msgstr "Beste disko bat ezkutatuta dago BIOS ezarpen baten ondorioz."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Another install or removal is running ({doing}). This waits for it to finish,"
" then goes on."
msgstr ""
"Beste instalazio edo kentze bat egiten ari da ({doing}). Hura amaitu arte "
"itxarongo da, eta gero jarraituko du."

msgid ""
"Another version is set to start at your next restart (after Undo the last "
"update, or picking a version in the boot menu), so the test wouldn't test "
"anything. Restart first, then run the test."
msgstr ""
"Beste bertsio bat ezarrita dago hurrengo berrabiaraztean abiatzeko (Desegin "
"azken eguneratzea erabili ondoren, edo abio-menuan bertsio bat aukeratu "
"ondoren), beraz, probak ez luke ezer probatuko. Berrabiarazi lehenik, eta "
"gero egin proba."

msgid "App"
msgstr "Aplikazioa"

msgid "App, game or port number"
msgstr "Aplikazioa, jokoa edo ataka-zenbakia"

msgid ""
"Applies them at login: the next slide for \"at each login\", and dark or "
"light for the time of day"
msgstr ""
"Saioa hastean aplikatzen ditu: hurrengo diapositiba \"saio-hasiera "
"bakoitzean\" aukerarako, eta iluna edo argia eguneko orduaren arabera"

msgid "Apps"
msgstr "Aplikazioak"

msgid "Apps and ports let in"
msgstr "Sartzen utzitako aplikazioak eta atakak"

msgid "Apps from Bazaar have this setting inside the app."
