#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The certificate \"{name}\" was added to this computer and has been removed, "
"so it's no longer trusted. If you didn't remove it, tell your helper."
msgstr ""
"\"{name}\" ziurtagiria ordenagailu honetan gehitu zen eta gero kendu egin da,"
" beraz, jada ez da fidagarritzat hartzen. Ez baduzu zuk kendu, esan zure "
"laguntzaileari."

msgid "The certificates couldn't be checked."
msgstr "Ezin izan dira ziurtagiriak egiaztatu."

msgid "The change was not made, and nothing was left behind."
msgstr "Ez da aldaketa egin, eta ez da ezer geratu atzean."

msgid "The check couldn't finish."
msgstr "Ezin izan da egiaztapena amaitu."

msgid "The clock and time zone settings could not be saved."
msgstr "Ezin izan dira gorde erlojuaren eta ordu-zonaren ezarpenak."

msgid ""
"The codecs are installed. They start working after a restart, which the setup"
" checklist offers at its end."
msgstr ""
"Kodekak instalatuta daude. Berrabiarazi ondoren hasiko dira funtzionatzen; "
"konfigurazio-egiaztapen-zerrendak amaieran eskaintzen du berrabiarazteko "
"aukera."

msgid ""
"The codecs are installed.\\n\\nRecommended: Restart now to start using them. "
"Or Later."
msgstr ""
"Kodekak instalatuta daude.\\n\\nGomendatua: Berrabiarazi orain erabiltzen "
"hasteko. Edo Geroago."

msgid "The codecs are removed. Restart to finish."
msgstr "Kodekak kendu dira. Berrabiarazi amaitzeko."

msgid "The codecs weren't removed."
msgstr "Kodekak ez dira kendu."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The computer didn't start properly with the boot options changed in "
"Wheelhouse, so it went back to the version from {since}, with the boot "
"options it had before."
msgstr ""
"Ordenagailua ez zen behar bezala abiatu Wheelhouse-n aldatutako abio-"
"aukerekin, beraz, {since}(e)ko bertsiora itzuli zen, lehen zituen abio-"
"aukerekin."

msgid ""
"The computer hasn't saved a copy of its settings since this start yet. Wait a"
" few minutes and try again. If it keeps saying this, tell your helper: the "
"copy isn't being saved."
msgstr ""
"Ordenagailuak oraindik ez du bere ezarpenen kopiarik gorde abio honetatik. "
"Itxaron minutu batzuk eta saiatu berriro. Hori esaten jarraitzen badu, esan "
"zure laguntzaileari: kopia ez da gordetzen ari."

msgid "The computer locks up"
msgstr "Ordenagailua blokeatzen da"

msgid ""
"The computer may not start, or may lose its drive, memory or processors."
msgstr ""
"Baliteke ordenagailua ez abiatzea, edo bere diskoa, memoria edo prozesadoreak"
" galtzea."

msgid ""
"The computer restarts and opens its BIOS settings screen. Save your work first.\n"
"\n"
"The BIOS settings are used with the keyboard. When you're done, choose Save and Exit, or Exit, to start the computer again."
msgstr ""
"Ordenagailua berrabiarazi egiten da eta BIOS ezarpenen pantaila irekitzen du. Gorde zure lana lehenik.\n"
"\n"
"BIOS ezarpenak teklatuarekin erabiltzen dira. Amaitzean, aukeratu Save and Exit (Gorde eta irten) edo Exit (Irten) ordenagailua berriro abiarazteko."

msgid ""
"The computer restarts, fails on purpose, then goes back by itself. A note at "
"login says the test worked and what the test copy found broken."
msgstr ""
"Ordenagailua berrabiarazi egiten da, nahita huts egiten du, eta gero bere "
"kabuz itzultzen da. Saioa hastean ohar batek esaten du probak funtzionatu "
"duela eta proba-kopiak zer aurkitu duen hondatuta."

msgid "The computer starts with the usual settings."
msgstr "Ordenagailua ohiko ezarpenekin abiatzen da."

msgid ""
"The computer would start without the desktop: a text screen or a rescue "
"shell."
msgstr ""
"Ordenagailua mahaigainik gabe abiatuko litzateke: testu-pantaila edo "
"erreskate-shell bat."

msgid "The desktop"
msgstr "Mahaigaina"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The device rule wasn't added, so the device may not work.\n"
"\n"
"{details}"
msgstr ""
"Gailu-araua ez da gehitu, beraz, baliteke gailua ez funtzionatzea.\n"
"\n"
"{details}"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The device rule wasn't added, so the device may not work.\n"
"{details}"
msgstr ""
"Gailu-araua ez da gehitu, beraz, baliteke gailua ez funtzionatzea.\n"
"{details}"

msgid "The disk is full. Free some space, then try again."
msgstr "Diskoa beteta dago. Askatu lekua eta saiatu berriro."

msgid "The disk is hidden by a BIOS setting."
msgstr "BIOS ezarpen batek diskoa ezkutatzen du."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The disk {disk} was not found, or can't be written to."
msgstr "Ez da {disk} diskoa aurkitu, edo ezin da bertan idatzi."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The download source stays. Open {filename} again to pick an app, or remove it"
" in Wheelhouse, Apps, Remove apps."
msgstr ""
"Deskarga-iturria mantentzen da. Ireki {filename} berriro aplikazio bat "
"aukeratzeko, edo kendu Wheelhouse, Aplikazioak, Kendu aplikazioak atalean."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The download source was added, but it has no apps to show right now. Check "
"your internet connection, then open {filename} again."
msgstr ""
"Deskarga-iturria gehitu da, baina oraintxe ez du erakusteko aplikaziorik. "
"Egiaztatu Interneteko konexioa, eta gero ireki {filename} berriro."

msgid ""
"The earlier version doesn't have the settings repair yet, so if the repair "
"didn't work, going back to it would give a wrong message. Run the test after "
"the next update."
msgstr ""
"Aurreko bertsioak oraindik ez du ezarpenen konponketa, beraz, konponketak "
"funtzionatu ez balu, hartara itzultzeak mezu okerra emango luke. Exekutatu "
"proba hurrengo eguneratzearen ondoren."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The file could not be written: {error}."
msgstr "Ezin izan da fitxategia idatzi: {error}."

msgid "The fingerprint reader"
msgstr "Hatz-marka irakurgailua"

msgid "The firewall"
msgstr "Suebakia"

msgid "The firewall didn't reload."
msgstr "Suebakia ez da berriro kargatu."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The firewall didn't take the change: {reason}"
msgstr "Suebakiak ez du aldaketa onartu: {reason}"

msgid "The firewall doesn't start"
msgstr "Suebakia ez da abiatzen"

msgid ""
"The firewall fails to start, so during the test the computer has no firewall."
msgstr ""
"Suebakiak huts egiten du abiatzean, beraz, probak irauten duen bitartean "
"ordenagailuak ez du suebakirik."

msgid "The firewall isn't answering"
msgstr "Suebakiak ez du erantzuten"

msgid "The firmware update didn't finish. Try again later."
msgstr "Firmware-eguneratzea ez da amaitu. Saiatu berriro geroago."

msgid "The firmware updater"
msgstr "Firmwarea eguneratzeko tresna"

msgid ""
"The first meeting asks whether to install Chrome or use your usual browser."
msgstr ""
"Lehen bilerak galdetzen du Chrome instalatu ala zure ohiko arakatzailea "
"erabili."

msgid ""
"The first time, choose Install Chrome or Use the usual browser. The meeting "
"opens in Zoom's web version."
msgstr ""
"Lehen aldian, aukeratu Instalatu Chrome edo Erabili ohiko arakatzailea. "
"Bilera Zoom-en web bertsioan irekitzen da."

msgid "The full codecs are already installed. Restart if you have not yet."
msgstr ""
"Kodek osoak dagoeneko instalatuta daude. Berrabiarazi, oraindik egin ez "
"baduzu."

msgid "The full guide"
msgstr "Gida osoa"

msgid "The full name is empty."
msgstr "Izen osoa hutsik dago."

msgid ""
"The graphics driver is blocked, so the screen runs in a basic mode: it may "
"look blurry or slow, or stay black (then just wait)."
msgstr ""
"Grafiko-kontrolatzailea blokeatuta dago, beraz, pantaila oinarrizko moduan "
"dabil: agian lauso edo motel egongo da, edo beltz geratuko da (horrelakoetan,"
" itxaron besterik ez)."

msgid "The install could not be finished."
msgstr "Ezin izan da instalazioa amaitu."

msgid "The install stopped"
msgstr "Instalazioa gelditu da"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The installer could not start: {error}"
msgstr "Ezin izan da instalatzailea abiarazi: {error}"

msgid "The installer couldn't open. Use Install EvenKeelOS in the dock."
msgstr ""
"Ezin izan da instalatzailea ireki. Erabili dock-eko Instalatu EvenKeelOS."

msgid "The installer stopped unexpectedly."
msgstr "Instalatzailea ustekabean gelditu da."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The keyboard ({device})"
msgstr "Teklatua ({device})"

msgid "The last lines of the log:"
msgstr "Egunkariaren azken lerroak:"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The last start failed its start-up checks, and some system settings were missing or replaced. Your computer put back {n} from the copy it saved {saved}, then restarted. Your files and apps aren't touched.\n"
"\n"
"Put back: {what}.\n"
"\n"
"If it happens again, tell your helper. Save problem details in Wheelhouse makes a file to send them."
msgid_plural ""
"The last start failed its start-up checks, and some system settings were missing or replaced. Your computer put back {n} from the copy it saved {saved}, then restarted. Your files and apps aren't touched.\n"
"\n"
"Put back: {what}.\n"
"\n"
"If it happens again, tell your helper. Save problem details in Wheelhouse makes a file to send them."
msgstr[0] ""
"Azken abioak ez ditu abioko egiaztapenak gainditu, eta sistema-ezarpen batzuk falta ziren edo ordezkatuta zeuden. Zure ordenagailuak {n} ezarpen berrezarri du {saved} gorde zuen kopiatik, eta gero berrabiarazi egin da. Zure fitxategiak eta aplikazioak ez dira ukitu.\n"
"\n"
"Berrezarrita: {what}.\n"
"\n"
"Berriro gertatzen bada, esan zure laguntzaileari. Wheelhouse-ko Gorde arazoaren xehetasunak aukerak fitxategi bat sortzen du haiek bidaltzeko."
msgstr[1] ""
"Azken abioak ez ditu abioko egiaztapenak gainditu, eta sistema-ezarpen batzuk falta ziren edo ordezkatuta zeuden. Zure ordenagailuak {n} ezarpen berrezarri ditu {saved} gorde zuen kopiatik, eta gero berrabiarazi egin da. Zure fitxategiak eta aplikazioak ez dira ukitu.\n"
"\n"
"Berrezarrita: {what}.\n"
"\n"
"Berriro gertatzen bada, esan zure laguntzaileari. Wheelhouse-ko Gorde arazoaren xehetasunak aukerak fitxategi bat sortzen du haiek bidaltzeko."

msgid "The layout didn't change."
msgstr "Diseinua ez da aldatu."

msgid ""
"The layout, colors, wallpaper, dark at night, fonts, screen size, night "
"light, sound and accounts"
msgstr ""
"Diseinua, koloreak, horma-papera, iluna gauez, letra-tipoak, pantailaren "
"tamaina, gaueko argia, soinua eta kontuak"

msgid "The login screen doesn't start"
msgstr "Saio-hasierako pantaila ez da abiatzen"

msgid ""
"The login screen fails to start, so you never see it. The computer restarts "
"by itself within seconds, twice, and the third start is back on this version."
msgstr ""
"Saio-hasierako pantailak huts egiten du abiatzean, beraz, ez duzu inoiz "
"ikusten. Ordenagailua bere kabuz berrabiarazten da segundo gutxiren buruan, "
"bi aldiz, eta hirugarren abioan bertsio honetara itzultzen da."

msgid ""
"The login screen works, but logging in drops you back to it. Log in a second "
"time; after the second drop the computer restarts by itself. Do that on 2 "
"starts, and the third start is back on this version."
msgstr ""
"Saio-hasierako pantailak funtzionatzen du, baina saioa hastean bertara "
"itzultzen zara. Hasi saioa bigarren aldiz; bigarren itzuleraren ondoren "
"ordenagailua bere kabuz berrabiarazten da. Egin hori 2 abiotan, eta "
"hirugarren abioan bertsio honetara itzultzen da."

msgid "The media codecs start working after a restart."
msgstr "Multimedia kodekak berrabiarazi ondoren hasten dira funtzionatzen."

msgid ""
"The menu that opens has Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, the sound volume, the screen "
"brightness, the power mode, dark style and night light."
msgstr ""
"Irekitzen den menuan hauek daude: wifia, Bluetootha, soinuaren bolumena, "
"pantailaren distira, energiaren modua, estilo iluna eta gaueko argia."

msgid "The new files could not be labelled."
msgstr "Ezin izan dira fitxategi berriak etiketatu."

msgid "The new partitions did not show up."
msgstr "Partizio berriak ez dira agertu."

msgid "The new system could not be set to take signed updates."
msgstr ""
"Ezin izan da sistema berria konfiguratu sinatutako eguneratzeak har ditzan."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The new system has no {name} group."
msgstr "Sistema berriak ez du {name} talderik."

msgid "The new system's desktop layouts could not be found."
msgstr "Ezin izan dira aurkitu sistema berriaren mahaigaineko diseinuak."

msgid "The new system's settings database could not be found."
msgstr "Ezin izan da aurkitu sistema berriaren ezarpenen datu-basea."

msgid "The next network you join starts as a Public place."
msgstr "Konektatzen zaren hurrengo sarea Leku publiko gisa hasiko da."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The next start uses: {settings}"
msgstr "Hurrengo abioak hau erabiliko du: {settings}"

msgid "The one-time setup window is already closed."
msgstr ""
"Behin bakarrik erabiltzen den konfigurazio-leihoa dagoeneko itxita dago."

msgid "The password is typed and matches."
msgstr "Pasahitza idatzita dago eta bat dator."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The password wasn't saved: {reason}"
msgstr "Pasahitza ez da gorde: {reason}"

msgid ""
"The picture is copied, ready to paste, and saved in Pictures, Screenshots."
msgstr ""
"Irudia kopiatuta dago, itsasteko prest, eta Irudiak, Pantaila-argazkiak "
"karpetan gordeta."

msgid ""
"The power button in that menu has Suspend, Restart, Power Off and Log Out."
msgstr ""
"Menu horretako itzaltzeko botoiak aukera hauek ditu: Eseki, Berrabiarazi, "
"Itzali eta Amaitu saioa."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The printer driver {title} is ready."
msgstr "{title} inprimagailu-kontrolatzailea prest dago."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The printer driver {title} is ready.\n"
"\n"
"Open Printers: choose Add Printer, then your printer."
msgstr ""
"{title} inprimagailu-kontrolatzailea prest dago.\n"
"\n"
"Ireki Inprimagailuak: aukeratu Gehitu inprimagailua, eta gero zure inprimagailua."

msgid "The printing service fails to start."
msgstr "Inprimatze-zerbitzuak huts egiten du abiatzean."

msgid "The restart didn't start"
msgstr "Berrabiaraztea ez da hasi"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The restart said:\n"
"\n"
"{message}\n"
"\n"
"Exit code: {code}"
msgstr ""
"Berrabiarazteak hau esan du:\n"
"\n"
"{message}\n"
"\n"
"Irteera-kodea: {code}"

msgid ""
"The root account is the system's own administrator. Most people never need "
"it: your own account can be an administrator instead."
msgstr ""
"Root kontua sistemaren administratzailea da. Jende gehienak ez du inoiz behar"
" izaten: zure kontua administratzaile izan daiteke, horren ordez."

msgid "The root password could not be set."
msgstr "Ezin izan da root pasahitza ezarri."

msgid "The screen flashes white, often with an outside display"
msgstr "Pantailak keinu zuriak egiten ditu, askotan kanpoko pantaila batekin"

msgid ""
"The settings are deleted, but the computer didn't restart. Restart it now: "
"the next start puts them back."
msgstr ""
"Ezarpenak ezabatu dira, baina ordenagailua ez da berrabiarazi. Berrabiarazi "
"orain: hurrengo abioak berrezarriko ditu."

msgid "The settings repair test didn't work."
msgstr "Ezarpenak konpontzeko probak ez du funtzionatu."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The settings repair test didn't work: your computer couldn't put the deleted settings back, so it went back to the version from {since}, which has its own settings. Your files and apps aren't touched, and automatic updates aren't paused.\n"
"\n"
"Tell your helper. Save problem details in Wheelhouse makes a file to send them."
msgstr ""
"Ezarpenak konpontzeko probak ez du funtzionatu: zure ordenagailuak ezin izan ditu ezabatutako ezarpenak berrezarri, beraz, {since}(e)ko bertsiora itzuli da, bere ezarpen propioak dituena. Zure fitxategiak eta aplikazioak ez dira ukitu, eta eguneratze automatikoak ez daude pausatuta.\n"
"\n"
"Esan zure laguntzaileari. Wheelhouse-ko Gorde arazoaren xehetasunak aukerak fitxategi bat sortzen du haiek bidaltzeko."

msgid "The settings repair test worked."
msgstr "Ezarpenak konpontzeko probak funtzionatu du."

msgid "The sound chip's driver is blocked, so there's no sound."
msgstr ""
"Soinu-txiparen kontrolatzailea blokeatuta dago, beraz, ez dago soinurik."

msgid ""
"The start menu, windows, the menu at the end of the bar, notifications, "
"screenshots and shortcuts"
msgstr ""
"Hasiera-menua, leihoak, barraren amaierako menua, jakinarazpenak, pantaila-"
"argazkiak eta lasterbideak"

msgid "The sun doesn't set or rise here today, so it's dark until it rises."
msgstr ""
"Gaur eguzkia ez da hemen ez sartzen ez ateratzen, beraz, iluna da eguzkia "
"atera arte."

msgid "The sun doesn't set or rise here today, so it's light until it sets."
msgstr ""
"Gaur eguzkia ez da hemen ez sartzen ez ateratzen, beraz, argia da eguzkia "
"sartu arte."

msgid "The system core crashed (a protection fault)"
msgstr "Sistemaren nukleoak huts egin du (babes-akats bat)"

msgid "The system core crashed (an oops)"
msgstr "Sistemaren nukleoak huts egin du (oops bat)"

msgid "The system core reported a bug"
msgstr "Sistemaren nukleoak akats bat jakinarazi du"

msgid ""
"The system itself can't be changed by apps or by mistake. Each update "
"replaces it whole."
msgstr ""
"Aplikazioek ezin dute sistema bera aldatu, ezta nahi gabe ere. Eguneratze "
"bakoitzak osorik ordezkatzen du."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The test copy ({name}) is ready. It starts at your next restart."
msgstr "Proba-kopia ({name}) prest dago. Hurrengo berrabiaraztean hasiko da."

msgid ""
"The test marker is removed. The version without it starts at your next "
"restart."
msgstr ""
"Proba-markagailua kendu da. Hura gabeko bertsioa hurrengo berrabiaraztean "
"hasiko da."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The test worked. At the next start your computer found important settings missing, put back {n} setting from the copy it saved {saved}, and restarted by itself.\n"
"\n"
"Put back: {what}."
msgid_plural ""
"The test worked. At the next start your computer found important settings missing, put back {n} settings from the copy it saved {saved}, and restarted by itself.\n"
"\n"
"Put back: {what}."
msgstr[0] ""
"Probak funtzionatu du. Hurrengo abioan, zure ordenagailuak ezarpen garrantzitsuak falta zirela ikusi zuen, {n} ezarpen berrezarri zuen {saved} gorde zuen kopiatik, eta bere kabuz berrabiarazi zen.\n"
"\n"
"Berrezarrita: {what}."
msgstr[1] ""
"Probak funtzionatu du. Hurrengo abioan, zure ordenagailuak ezarpen garrantzitsuak falta zirela ikusi zuen, {n} ezarpen berrezarri zituen {saved} gorde zuen kopiatik, eta bere kabuz berrabiarazi zen.\n"
"\n"
"Berrezarrita: {what}."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The test worked. Your computer went back by itself to the version from "
"{since}, and the test copy is removed."
msgstr ""
"Probak funtzionatu du. Zure ordenagailua bere kabuz itzuli da {since}(e)ko "
"bertsiora, eta proba-kopia kendu da."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The touchpad ({device})"
msgstr "Ukipen-panela ({device})"

msgid "The two don't match yet."
msgstr "Biak oraindik ez datoz bat."

msgid "The update did not finish. Details: journalctl -u %s"
msgstr "Eguneratzea ez da amaitu. Xehetasunak: journalctl -u %s"

msgid "The update didn't finish."
msgstr "Eguneratzea ez da amaitu."

msgid ""
"The update didn't finish. Nothing is broken: your computer keeps running the "
"version it has.\\n\\nTry again later."
msgstr ""
"Eguneratzea ez da amaitu. Ez dago ezer hondatuta: zure ordenagailuak duen "
"bertsioa erabiltzen jarraitzen du.\\n\\nSaiatu berriro geroago."

msgid "The update program"
msgstr "Eguneratze-programa"

msgid ""
"The update program is swapped for one that always fails (until the next "
"restart; nothing on the disk changes)."
msgstr ""
"Eguneratze-programa beti huts egiten duen batekin ordezkatzen da (hurrengo "
"berrabiarazi arte; diskoan ez da ezer aldatzen)."

msgid "The user name is empty."
msgstr "Erabiltzaile-izena hutsik dago."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The version you're using now is from {current}. The one from before it, from {older}, is still on this computer.\n"
"\n"
"If something stopped working after the last update: Undo the update. The version from {older} starts at your next restart. Your files and your apps aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"Orain erabiltzen ari zaren bertsioa {current}(e)koa da. Haren aurrekoa, {older}(e)koa, ordenagailu honetan dago oraindik.\n"
"\n"
"Azken eguneratzearen ondoren zerbaitek funtzionatzeari utzi badio: Desegin eguneratzea. {older}(e)ko bertsioa hurrengo berrabiaraztean hasiko da. Zure fitxategiak eta aplikazioak ez dira ukitzen."

msgid ""
"The version you're using now is the one before it with boot options changed in Wheelhouse.\n"
"\n"
"Undo the change: the computer starts with the boot options it had before, at your next restart. Automatic updates aren't paused.\n"
"\n"
"Or Cancel."
msgstr ""
"Orain erabiltzen ari zaren bertsioa aurrekoa da, Wheelhouse-n abio-aukerak aldatuta.\n"
"\n"
"Desegin aldaketa: hurrengo berrabiaraztean, ordenagailua lehen zituen abio-aukerekin abiatuko da. Eguneratze automatikoak ez dira pausatzen.\n"
"\n"
"Edo Utzi."

msgid "The wallpaper changes to the next picture in a folder of yours."
msgstr "Horma-papera zure karpeta bateko hurrengo irudira aldatzen da."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The {fs} file system could not be loaded, so the disk can't be prepared."
msgstr ""
"Ezin izan da {fs} fitxategi-sistema kargatu, beraz, diskoa ezin da prestatu."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {label} is deleted."
msgstr "{label} ezabatu da."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {label} is not working."
msgstr "{label} ez dabil."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {label} is repaired."
msgstr "{label} konponduta dago."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The {label} isn't working.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Repair the box. It rebuilds the box, puts your apps back, then installs {title}. Your files aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"{label} ez dabil.\n"
"\n"
"Gomendatua: Konpondu kutxa. Kutxa berreraikitzen du, zure aplikazioak berrezartzen ditu, eta gero {title} instalatzen du. Zure fitxategiak ez dira ukitzen."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {name} ({unit})"
msgstr "{name} ({unit})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {name} graphics drive the screen."
msgstr "{name} grafikoek kontrolatzen dute pantaila."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {name} service ({unit})"
msgstr "{name} zerbitzua ({unit})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid "The {title} download isn't signed by ArtCraft, so it was not installed."
msgstr "{title} deskarga ez dago ArtCraft-ek sinatuta, beraz, ez da instalatu."

msgid "There are no app boxes to repair."
msgstr "Ez dago konpontzeko aplikazio-kutxarik."

#, python-brace-format
msgid "There is no start-up keyboard layout for {layout}."
msgstr "Ez dago abioko teklatu-diseinurik {layout}(e)rako."

msgid ""
"There's no earlier version on this computer to go back to. Only the version "
"you're using now is kept."
msgstr ""
"Ez dago ordenagailu honetan itzultzeko lehenagoko bertsiorik. Orain "
"erabiltzen ari zaren bertsioa soilik gordetzen da."

msgid ""
"There's no earlier version to fall back to if putting the settings back "
"doesn't work, so the test doesn't run. Try it after the next update."
msgstr ""
"Ez dago lehenagoko bertsiorik atzera itzultzeko ezarpenak berrezartzeak "
"funtzionatzen ez badu, beraz, proba ez da exekutatzen. Probatu hurrengo "
"eguneratzearen ondoren."

msgid "These security certificates need attention. Pick one to see what to do."
msgstr ""
"Segurtasun-ziurtagiri hauek arreta behar dute. Aukeratu bat zer egin "
"ikusteko."

msgid "They open in Chrome."
msgstr "Chrome-n irekitzen dira."

msgid "They open in your usual browser. Choose to be asked about Chrome again."
msgstr ""
"Zure ohiko arakatzailean irekitzen dira. Aukeratu Chrome-ri buruz berriro "
"galdetzea."

msgid "This account can't share folders."
msgstr "Kontu honek ezin ditu karpetak partekatu."

msgid ""
"This computer asks for the disk password every time it starts. The computer's security chip can unlock the disk instead.\n"
"\n"
"This needs the disk password, so it's one for your helper.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Set it up. Or Skip: it's in Wheelhouse any time."
msgstr ""
"Ordenagailu honek diskoaren pasahitza eskatzen du abiatzen den bakoitzean. Ordenagailuaren segurtasun-txipak desblokea dezake diskoa horren ordez.\n"
"\n"
"Honek diskoaren pasahitza behar du, beraz, zure laguntzailearentzako zeregina da.\n"
"\n"
"Gomendatua: Konfiguratu. Edo Saltatu: Wheelhouse-n dago, edozein unetan."

msgid ""
"This computer can't go back by itself: it was installed before automatic "
"rollback was added, or automatic rollback was switched off. Computers "
"installed from a newer USB have it."
msgstr ""
"Ordenagailu honek ezin du bere kabuz atzera itzuli: atzera-egite automatikoa "
"gehitu aurretik instalatu zen, edo atzera-egite automatikoa desaktibatu egin "
"zen. USB berriago batetik instalatutako ordenagailuek badute."

msgid ""
"This computer can't open its BIOS settings from here. Press the BIOS key "
"while it starts (often F2, F10, F12 or Delete)."
msgstr ""
"Ordenagailu honek ezin ditu bere BIOS ezarpenak hemendik ireki. Sakatu BIOS "
"tekla abiatzen ari den bitartean (askotan F2, F10, F12 edo Delete)."

msgid ""
"This computer has no security chip (TPM) that can do this, so the disk "
"password stays."
msgstr ""
"Ordenagailu honek ez du hori egin dezakeen segurtasun-txipik (TPM), beraz, "
"diskoaren pasahitza mantenduko da."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This computer is running a test copy ({name}) as its normal version, so a new test can't start from it.\n"
"\n"
"Recommended: Remove the test marker. The version without it starts at your next restart. Needs your password."
msgstr ""
"Ordenagailu honek proba-kopia bat ({name}) exekutatzen du bere bertsio normal gisa, beraz, ezin da proba berri bat hartatik abiarazi.\n"
"\n"
"Gomendatua: Kendu proba-markagailua. Hura gabeko bertsioa hurrengo berrabiaraztean hasiko da. Zure pasahitza behar du."

msgid ""
"This computer is running a test copy. Open Test automatic rollback again to "
"remove its marker."
msgstr ""
"Ordenagailu honek proba-kopia bat exekutatzen du. Ireki berriro Probatu "
"atzera-egite automatikoa haren markagailua kentzeko."

msgid "This computer started the USB stick in old BIOS (legacy) mode."
msgstr ""
"Ordenagailu honek USB memoria BIOS zaharreko (legacy) moduan abiarazi du."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This desktop uses {now}.\n"
"\n"
"Switch to {new}? It takes effect after you log out and back in.\n"
"\n"
"Or Keep it."
msgstr ""
"Mahaigain honek {now} erabiltzen du.\n"
"\n"
"{new} aukerara aldatu? Saioa amaitu eta berriro hasi ondoren aplikatzen da.\n"
"\n"
"Edo Mantendu."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This file can't be installed. It may be damaged or not fully downloaded. Download it again and retry.\n"
"\n"
"(Details: {details})"
msgstr ""
"Ezin da fitxategi hau instalatu. Baliteke kaltetuta egotea edo guztiz deskargatu gabe egotea. Deskargatu berriro eta saiatu berriro.\n"
"\n"
"(Xehetasunak: {details})"

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This file is an older version of {title} than the one you have.\n"
"\n"
"Install the older version: replaces yours. Only do this if the newer one has a problem."
msgstr ""
"Fitxategi hau {title} aplikazioaren bertsio zaharrago bat da, zuk duzuna baino.\n"
"\n"
"Instalatu bertsio zaharragoa: zurea ordezkatzen du. Egin hau bertsio berriagoak arazoren bat badu soilik."

msgid ""
"This is a live session: it runs from the USB stick, nothing here is saved, "
"and the computer's disk isn't touched."
msgstr ""
"Hau zuzeneko saio bat da: USB memoriatik exekutatzen da, hemen ez da ezer "
"gordetzen, eta ordenagailuaren diskoa ez da ukitzen."

msgid ""
"This is how the computer shows up on your network. Keep the suggestion, or "
"type a new one."
msgstr ""
"Horrela agertzen da ordenagailua zure sarean. Mantendu iradokizuna, edo "
"idatzi berri bat."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This is the 32-bit version of {title}, for older computers. Download the "
"64-bit version instead (often called amd64 or x86_64)."
msgstr ""
"Hau {title} aplikazioaren 32 biteko bertsioa da, ordenagailu zaharretarako. "
"Deskargatu 64 biteko bertsioa horren ordez (askotan amd64 edo x86_64 deitua)."

msgid "This network"
msgstr "Sare hau"

msgid ""
"This removes things the computer no longer needs: unused app parts, old "
"system update files, and unused container images. Your files and your apps "
"aren't touched."
msgstr ""
"Honek ordenagailuak jada behar ez dituen gauzak kentzen ditu: erabiltzen ez "
"diren aplikazio-zatiak, sistema-eguneratzeen fitxategi zaharrak eta "
"erabiltzen ez diren edukiontzi-irudiak. Zure fitxategiak eta aplikazioak ez "
"dira ukitzen."

#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"This saves the computer's recent error messages, its system version and the list of your apps to one file, {name}, in your Documents folder. What your apps showed or opened isn't in it.\n"
"\n"
"Then email that file to your helper. They can see what went wrong without being here.\n"
"\n"
"Nothing is sent anywhere by itself."
msgstr ""
"Honek ordenagailuaren azken errore-mezuak, sistemaren bertsioa eta zure aplikazioen zerrenda fitxategi bakar batean gordetzen ditu, {name}, zure Dokumentuak karpetan. Zure aplikazioek erakutsi edo ireki zutena ez dago bertan.\n"
"\n"
"Gero, bidali fitxategi hori posta elektronikoz zure laguntzaileari. Zer gertatu den ikus dezake hemen egon gabe.\n"
"\n"
"Ez da ezer bidaltzen inora bere kabuz."

msgid ""
"This sets what other devices on this network can reach. Pick Public place "
"anywhere you're not sure. You can change it later in Wheelhouse, Network "
"safety."
msgstr ""
"Honek zehazten du sare honetako beste gailuak zertara irits daitezkeen. "
"Aukeratu Leku publikoa ziur ez zauden edozein lekutan. Gero alda dezakezu "
"Wheelhouse, Sareko segurtasuna atalean."

msgid ""
"This sets what you see at first. The next step suggests a desktop layout to "
"match, and the guide is in Wheelhouse, Get help, either way."
msgstr ""
"Honek hasieran ikusten duzuna ezartzen du. Hurrengo urratsak bat datorren "
"mahaigain-diseinu bat iradokitzen du, eta gida Wheelhouse, Lortu laguntza "
"atalean dago, edonola ere."

msgid "This setting is risky"
msgstr "Ezarpen hau arriskutsua da"

